From: Thomas Bertels <3265870+tbertels@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:09:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] helpers: Use primary screen as fallback for screenAt

QGuiApplication::screenAt can return nullptr if the point
(QCursor::pos() in this case) is outside of any screen.

Fixes: 7627c48411c626f0da24fafd3f19c424411f16b7
("helpers,main:mainwindow: fix deprecated use of desktop widget")

Fixes #1166 ("Cannot get Flatpak to open properly").
---
 src/helpers.cpp | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/helpers.cpp b/src/helpers.cpp
index 96483cf3..32b341a6 100644
--- a/src/helpers.cpp
+++ b/src/helpers.cpp
@@ -695,6 +695,8 @@ bool Helpers::pointFromString(QPoint &point, const QString &text)
 QRect Helpers::availableGeometryFromPoint(const QPoint &point)
 {
     QScreen *screen = QGuiApplication::screenAt(point);
+    if (!screen)
+        screen = QGuiApplication::primaryScreen();
     return screen->availableGeometry();
 }
 
